      ":question/problem": "Solve for $\\mathbf{x}\\in\\mathbb{R}^4$ if\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{x}\\right)-3\\mathbf{x}=\\mathbf{b}+0\\mathbf{x}\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
